@startuml Teacher Profiles Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Teacher profiles — scoped listing and club assignment

actor "Admin / Coordinator" as Client
participant TeacherProfilesController as Controller
participant "Get / Update TeacherProfilesService" as Service
database "MySQL\nTeacherProfilesRepository" as Repository

alt List or detail
  Client -> Controller : GET /teacher-profiles
  Controller -> Service : filters + access context
  Service -> Repository : query within role scope
  Repository --> Client : paginated profile DTOs
else Assign or unassign club
  Client -> Controller : PATCH .../assign-club or unassign-club
  Controller -> Service : teacherId + clubId + context
  Service -> Service : require admin or coordinator over target club
  Service -> Repository : move assignment or clear it
  Repository --> Client : success message
end

note over Service, Repository
  Assignment moves a teacher from the previous club.
  Profile lifecycle itself is owned by the User module.
end note
@enduml
